yDNB92ej9O9VNN6KUV40vZao3SzjxPLjiRZPBL4g&oe=6B0C7CAE"}, {"file_name": "hypnotic_kaamo_screenshot2.png", "id": "1317082187162279", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_1317082190495612_5168883647151663368_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GUO2HgfMdhMQ7kNvwF6dMo6&_nc_oc=AdqT3BipIQhol4SAbFEBPGEAzKn6t-m-FfFBHR-11B0flsZ9xJHPvE8KSmrzoOpz5u8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTC5nAQu550k3MUZ3eE3kve3wivRCO98-IW6hKTMiywLw&oe=6B0C6E51"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hypnotic Kaamo", "keywords": ["hypnosis", "kaa", "camo", "snake", "hypno"], "long_description": "Meet Kaamo, a snake who is eager to give you a good look in the eye, but his intentions may not be so pure. This short game allows you to immerse yourself, up close and personal, with the hypnotic snake. Avoid his gaze by turning your head, covering your eyes... or just smacking him away!\n\nBeware, Kaamo learns. He observes what movements catch your attention the most and slowly adapts to your playstyle. Keep relying on the same tricks, and he may find a way around them. Stay unpredictable, and for your own sake... don't trust in him.\n\nFeatures:\n* Physics-based interactions\n* Fully voice acted snake\n* Kaamo adapts his behavior to your playstyle the more you play\n* Answer Kaamo's questions with a nod or shake of your head and he responds\n* Unlockable gamemodes (more to come!)\n* Experiment, practice and challenge Kaamo on your own terms in sandbox mode", "short_description": "Experience the powers of a hypnotic snake up close! Avert your gaze, cover your eyes... or just slap him away! \n\nThis short game allows you to experience a close and personal encounter with the hypnotic Kaamo. Immerse yourself into the role of a human caught by the snake. Unlock more gamemodes, interact with Kaamo and show him that you're not a weak human!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "deve